  "body": "Like all PUT and POST requests other than the media ones (and `/logout`...), `/forget` is supposed to take a JSON body, e.g. `{}` if nothing special is required. Currently Synapse as at v1.92.3 does not require this.\r\n\r\n#16365 adds a warning against this.\r\n\r\nWe should see if any clients are hitting this and then a future version should cut this off completely.",
